metadata
    Title : Cabin State Machine Diagram
    Author : Leon Starr
    Document ID : mint.elevator3.td.6
    Modification date : August 3, 2026
    Version : 3.6.0
    Organization : Model Integration, LLC
    Copyright notice > MIT
    Organization logo > mint
domain Elevator Management
class Cabin
interaction events
    Doors secure
    New transfer
    Take out of service
    Arrived at floor
    Cabin stopping
    Try redirect
    Transport unavailable
    Go
    Destination update
    Passing floor
completion events
    Prepare to move
    Already there
    Change requested
    Transport in progress
    Transfer notified
    Location updated
--
state Update location( floor: Level Name )
activity
    &R43 /R2/R28/Shaft Level(1, ^floor )
    Passing floor( ^floor) -> ~UI
    Location updated -> me
transitions
    Location updated > MOVING
--
state Notify transfer( new dest: Level Name )
activity
    Cabin redirected( updated dest: ^new dest ) -> /R53/Transfer
    Transfer notified -> me
transitions
    Transfer notified > MOVING
--
state Request destination( new dest: Level Name )
activity
    Go to floor( dest floor: ^new dest ) -> ~TRANS
    Change requested -> me
transitions
    Change requested > MOVING
--
state READY TO GO
activity
    Ready to go -> /R53/Transfer
transitions
    Take out of service > OUT OF SERVICE
    Go > Requesting transport
can't happen
    Doors secure
        Doors can’t get back to the state where they report this until we’ve gone through
        another move cycle and have been locked again.
    New transfer
        <Transfer already exists> Transfer already exists and won’t be deleted until we get
        through another move cycle.
    Arrived at floor
        <Cabin already stopped> Cabin is already stopped.
    Cabin stopping
        <Unexpected stop> No emergency stop was requested.
    Try redirect
        <No redirect until moving> We have a new Transfer and it can’t ask for a redirect
        until we get moving again.
    Transport unavailable
        <Cabin not moving> Cannot occur if cabin is not moving
    Destination update
        <Cabin not moving>
    Passing floor
        <Cabin not moving>
--
state SECURING DOORS
activity
    my door .= /R4/Door
    my door.Lock requested.set
    Lock -> my door
transitions
    Doors secure > READY TO GO
    Take out of service > OUT OF SERVICE
can't happen
    New transfer
        <Transfer already exists>
    Arrived at floor
        <Cabin already stopped>
    Try redirect
        <No redirect until moving>
    Go
        No, the whole point is to hold here until the transfer acknowledges that door is
        in the Locked state and the cabin is stationary.
    Cabin stopping
        <Unexpected stop>
    Transport unavailable
        <Cabin not moving>
    Destination update
        <Cabin not moving>
    Passing floor
        <Cabin not moving>
--
state Are we already there?
activity
    /R53/Transfer.Destination floor == /R43/Shaft Level.Floor ?
        Already there -> : Prepare to move -> me
transitions
    Prepare to move > SECURING DOORS
    Already there > PICKUP DROPOFF
--
state PICKUP DROPOFF
activity
    Cabin at destination -> /R53/Transfer
    Unlock -> /R4/Door
    ! /R2/Shaft.In service ? Take out of service -> me
transitions
    New transfer > Are we already there?
    Take out of service > OUT OF SERVICE
ignore
    Try redirect
        Possible if Transfer requests redirect just as arrival occurs. We can safely ignore
        because when the Transfer completes it will trigger another search for service.
can't happen
    Doors secure
        This only happens in response to lock requested in Securing Doors state. And we
        don’t leave that state until the event happens.
    Arrived at floor
        <Cabin already stopped>
    Go
        Transfer can’t send this event until after we advance to the Locking Transfer state.
    Cabin stopping
        <Unexpected stop>
    Transport unavailable
        <Cabin not moving>
    Destination update
        <Cabin not moving>
    Passing floor
        <Cabin not moving>
--
state Set emergency stop( nearest safe stop : Level Name)
activity
    Cabin redirected( updated dest: ^nearest safe stop) -> /R53/Transfer
transitions
    Arrived at floor > OUT OF SERVICE
--
state OUT OF SERVICE
activity
    /R4/Door.Emergency hold.set
    Passenger open -> /R4/Door
    /R2/Shaft.In service.unset
can't happen
    Doors secure
        <Out of service final state> Final state. Interacting instances should verify in
        service status before sending any events.
    New transfer
        <Out of service final state>
    Take out of service
        <Out of service final state>
    Arrived at floor
        <Out of service final state>
    Cabin stopping
        <Out of service final state>
    Try redirect
        <Out of service final state>
    Transport unavailable
        <Out of service final state>
    Go
        <Out of service final state>
    Destination update
        <Out of service final state>
    Passing floor
        <Out of service final state>
--
state EMERGENCY BRAKING
activity
    Stop at nearest floor -> ~TRANS
    /R2/Shaft.In service.unset
transitions
    Cabin stopping > Set emergency stop
ignore
    Take out of service
        We are already going out of service, so no need to react.
    Arrived at floor
        <Going out of service> Doesn't matter since we are going out of service.
    Try redirect
        <Going out of service>
    Transport unavailable
        <Going out of service>
    Destination update
        <Going out of service>
    Passing floor
        <Going out of service>
can't happen
    Doors secure
        The doors must already be closed if we are braking.
    New transfer
        The transfer in progress has not completed, so we can't get another one now.
    Go
        Transfer can’t send this event until after we advance to the Locking Transfer state.
--
state MOVING
activity
transitions
    Take out of service > EMERGENCY BRAKING
    Arrived at floor > PICKUP DROPOFF
    Try redirect > Request destination
    Destination update > Notify transfer
    Transport unavailable > OUT OF SERVICE
    Passing floor > Update location
can't happen
    Doors secure
        This is a serious ‘out of sync’ error. The doors must be secure (closed and locked)
        while the cabin is moving.
    New transfer
        The transfer has already directed the cabin to move and it only does it once,
        so it can’t happen again.
    Go
        The transfer has already directed us to go and it only does this once during
        its lifecycle.
    Cabin stopping
        <Unexpected stop>
--
state Requesting transport
activity
    Go to floor( dest floor: /R53/Transfer.Destination floor ) -> ~TRANS
    Transport in progress -> me
transitions
    Transport in progress > MOVING
--